  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いや、\r\n有休消化しろって、はづきさんに怒られちゃって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012009010240,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200901/2012009010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "凛世もオフの日だし、困ることはないと思うけど……\r\n一応連絡は取れるようにしとくから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012009010250,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "承知いたしました……\r\n──……その",
    "charAnim1": "shy3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200901/2012009010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012009010260,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "どこかへ……\r\nお出かけに……なるのですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200901/2012009010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　いや……\r\nははっ、そんな休暇だったらいいんだけどな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まぁ、洗濯して、掃除して……\r\nちょっとメシ食いに出て……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──ってやってたら、もう夕方だろうなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012009010270,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……\r\n洗濯して……掃除して……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "rinze",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201200901/2012009010270"
  },
  {
    "id": 2012009010280,
    "speaker": "凛世",
    "text": "……ふふ",
